                                                "text": "Oh, and don't forget your coat."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "461d4ad7-aa5e-3d5e-95fe-2216554bfeed",
                                        "entry_id": "991f08ce-908a-3f96-8883-80f82bda30c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An invocation or address (similar to the vocative in languages with noun declension), often with a term of endearment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c285b2c9-6b62-4c3d-9f68-1f6e5f85ceab",
                                                "sense_id": "461d4ad7-aa5e-3d5e-95fe-2216554bfeed",
                                                "text": "Oh, gosh"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5c1b7c30-9738-4b4f-b202-1fad7ce1cb89",
                                                "sense_id": "461d4ad7-aa5e-3d5e-95fe-2216554bfeed",
                                                "text": "Oh baby, baby, how was I supposed to know / That something wasn't right here?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0d575ac6-2513-32ff-a18a-c9e0b99d2701",
                                        "entry_id": "991f08ce-908a-3f96-8883-80f82bda30c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Exclamation for drama or emphasis (often poetic)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "83cc5573-5dd0-439a-bfcd-3bab8e3fd59b",
                                                "sense_id": "0d575ac6-2513-32ff-a18a-c9e0b99d2701",
                                                "text": "Oh, when will it end?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "09afc959-19df-41b9-95f3-d432ca1654d8",
                                                "sense_id": "0d575ac6-2513-32ff-a18a-c9e0b99d2701",
                                                "text": "And oh how stingingly acute, and pungently grievous and tormentive, are the remembrancing Reflections of a separate uncloathed Soul in the other World, upon a review of its mad Choice, foolish Hopes, fruitless Desires […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "82a6b97c-a408-4817-ac2c-6e18288ad505",
                                                "sense_id": "0d575ac6-2513-32ff-a18a-c9e0b99d2701",
                                                "text": "Oh, by what plots, by what forswearings, betrayings, oppressions, imprisonments, tortures, poisonings, and under what reasons of state and politic subtilty, have these forenamed kings […] pulled the vengeance of God upon themselves […]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3113a7fd-bf1d-3275-a076-d2e83c7eefea",
                                        "entry_id": "991f08ce-908a-3f96-8883-80f82bda30c9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Expression of pain. See ouch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "111270f6-afd5-4720-a094-41387e7c6bc9",
                                                "sense_id": "3113a7fd-bf1d-3275-a076-d2e83c7eefea",
                                                "text": "Oh! That hurt."
                                            },
